---
title: Local groups
# Site content → Local groups (server/local-groups.js): which groups of the
# local groups' board the community page's map shows, each city's pin and,
# if any, the page its name links to. Needs `local_groups_site`; the API
# checks it and sends nothing of the board's leads or links.
permalink: /app/content/local-groups/
tool: content
section: local-groups
pageTitle: Local groups
wide: true
noindex: true
excludeFromSitemap: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
seoTitle: 'Local groups | AI Safety for Italy'
---
{% extends "app.njk" %}
{% block page %}
    <div class="notice" id="lgNotLive" hidden style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
      <span><strong>Not published yet.</strong> The site still shows the cities written in the code. Choose the groups below and publish: from then on, the map is set here.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-site" id="lgSite" hidden>
      <figure class="panel lg-map-panel">
        <svg class="lg-map" id="lgMap" viewBox="0 0 420 560" role="img" aria-label="Map of Italy with the cities the site shows">
          {% include "italy-map-land.njk" %}
          <g id="lgPins"></g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption class="panel-note" id="lgMapHint">Tick a city to put it on the map; “Move the pin”, then click the map, to place it.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="lg-site-side">
        <div id="lgSiteList"></div>
        <div class="lg-publish">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="lgPreview">Preview</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="lgPublish">Publish to the site</button>
          <span class="panel-note" id="lgState"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="panel-note" id="lgUnpublishRow" hidden style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          If something goes wrong, the site can go back to the cities written in the code; nothing here is deleted.
          <button type="button" class="link-button" id="lgUnpublish">Go back to them</button>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="lgSiteMsg"></div>

    {# The community page's texts, for the preview (local-groups-site.js). #}
    <dialog class="panel lg-preview" id="lgPreviewDialog" aria-label="Preview of the map"
      data-title="{{ community.local_groups.title }}"
      data-join="{{ community.local_groups.join }}"
      data-start="{{ community.local_groups.start }}"
      data-start-link="{{ community.local_groups.start_link }}"
      data-mailing-list="{{ site.forms.mailingList }}">
      <div class="fe-preview-bar">
        <div class="fe-device" role="group" aria-label="Preview size" id="lgDevice">
          <button type="button" data-device="wide" aria-pressed="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg>Computer
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-device="phone" aria-pressed="false">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="2.5" width="10" height="19" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18.5h2"/></svg>Phone
          </button>
        </div>
        <span class="fe-preview-note">The community page, with the list as it is now. Nothing is published yet.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fe-frame" id="lgPreviewFrame">
        <iframe id="lgPreviewIframe" title="Preview of the community page's map"></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="lg-publish">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="lgPreviewPublish">Publish to the site</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="lgPreviewClose">Close</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>

<script src="/assets/js/meet/common.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/app-common.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/js/meet/local-groups-site.js?v={{ build }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
